{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/defc770e4463f627620b278aa4c490f7.poster.avif?t=1757584579\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/defc770e4463f627620b278aa4c490f7.webm?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/defc770e4463f627620b278aa4c490f7.mp4?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor. Chaos. Total Destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into high\u2011octane tank combat where every wall is just a temporary inconvenience. Everything you see on the map can be reduced to rubble. No artificial barriers\u2014only you, your rivals, and a battlefield that disappears under treads and heavy fire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/005f55b36bafe92946ac1d3dd249f6f3.poster.avif?t=1757584579\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/005f55b36bafe92946ac1d3dd249f6f3.webm?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/005f55b36bafe92946ac1d3dd249f6f3.mp4?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Why You\u2019ll Love It</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP With Friends:</strong> Squad up or face off in intense, fast\u2011paced tank battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power\u2011Ups &amp; Progression:</strong> Grab airborne drops or earn rewards mid\u2011match to boost armor, firepower, reload speed, mobility, and restore HP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up &amp; Unlock:</strong> Score big, unlock new stages, upgrade your tank, and carve your legend into the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Destructible Environments:</strong> Blast through buildings, defenses, and anything in your way\u2014create your own attack paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/2a0e79ba7b85cb22e1594f1adc51baee.poster.avif?t=1757584579\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/2a0e79ba7b85cb22e1594f1adc51baee.webm?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/2a0e79ba7b85cb22e1594f1adc51baee.mp4?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded1 Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a mine\u2011strewn battlefield packed with unique challenges and special rewards. Complete objectives, dodge traps, earn points\u2014every move is a risk that could pay off huge\u2026 or end in a spectacular explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d Co\u2011Op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up against AI forces. Capture and hold territory, build walls and traps, coordinate maneuvers. In this mode, teamwork is everything\u2014and the map rewards squads that think ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Classic Multiplayer: Free\u2011For\u2011All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rules. No mercy. Rack up points by destroying anyone who crosses your sightline. Play online with friends\u2014today\u2019s ally can be tomorrow\u2019s target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living, Hazard\u2011Filled Battlefield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missile turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden surprises you\u2019ll only discover in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map tests your reflexes, strategy, and nerve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Airdrops Change Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the skies: when a cargo plane appears, it\u2019s carrying rare loot. Reach the drop before your enemies to secure strategic upgrades\u2014reinforcements, repairs, limited\u2011time boosts, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up the engine, rally your crew, level the map, and prove whose tank rules the warzone. Your tactics. Your tracks. Your victory.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Tanker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/8e672e1c6af4e3a7e462646cfc900e38d991d97f.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/c388acea8d65128f5025ff80e4129939a358cd54.jpg"},{"name":"A Confident Tankman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/a2a4210a12a73acfda819308c16fac4e56eaf2d7.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/7ae4b4ddefe2bbc7be5cee81614c05c913369983.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/b2695710a99558825c194c4ed05ceca2fd43e3a8.jpg"},{"name":"Ammo Thrower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/088bdc6d4da7857cde1e195c0024f9ec93c078e2.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/c520c85c0f6c14360787eaf90a0f4a2e5dde0726.jpg"},{"name":"Maximum Endurance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/3245dc294635950aba1f8db1b208ff637ef5425d.jpg"},{"name":"Masquerade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1704170/8edb576121717aafeb8d1b16fd96e2b8f0737fe9.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1704170?t=1757584579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/fd402a5a9f6263540a546f67cfb984cee5566636/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757584579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/a4f70befb7d1ac6385fe48e428e658d7d3f6b0e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757584579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/a4f70befb7d1ac6385fe48e428e658d7d3f6b0e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757584579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/defc770e4463f627620b278aa4c490f7.poster.avif?t=1757584579\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/e