buildings, defenses, and anything in your way\u2014create your own attack paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/2a0e79ba7b85cb22e1594f1adc51baee.poster.avif?t=1757584579\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/2a0e79ba7b85cb22e1594f1adc51baee.webm?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/2a0e79ba7b85cb22e1594f1adc51baee.mp4?t=1757584579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded1 Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a mine\u2011strewn battlefield packed with unique challenges and special rewards. Complete objectives, dodge traps, earn points\u2014every move is a risk that could pay off huge\u2026 or end in a spectacular explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d Co\u2011Op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up against AI forces. Capture and hold territory, build walls and traps, coordinate maneuvers. In this mode, teamwork is everything\u2014and the map rewards squads that think ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Classic Multiplayer: Free\u2011For\u2011All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rules. No mercy. Rack up points by destroying anyone who crosses your sightline. Play online with friends\u2014today\u2019s ally can be tomorrow\u2019s target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living, Hazard\u2011Filled Battlefield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missile turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden surprises you\u2019ll only discover in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map tests your reflexes, strategy, and nerve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Airdrops Change Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the skies: when a cargo plane appears, it\u2019s carrying rare loot. Reach the drop before your enemies to secure strategic upgrades\u2014reinforcements, repairs, limited\u2011time boosts, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up the engine, rally your crew, level the map, and prove whose tank rules the warzone. Your tactics. Your tracks. Your victory.</p>","developers":["PunchWorks Interactive"],"dlc":[1826740],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/a4e922131646ac6261945ac6b590009da2187620/header.jpg?t=1757584579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1704170/304748839/d1712c215e38b34f1d736e3e571a9e7937f4511f/1753993151/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753993610","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1704170/304748839/d1712c215e38b34f1d736e3e571a9e7937f4511f/1753993151/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753993610","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1704170/304748839/d1712c215e38b34f1d736e3e571a9e7937f4511f/1753993151/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753993610","id":257176437,"name":"Tank Battle Royale","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176437/2f24f3f2f783f4de7c01b89ac79abfc2cd1526e0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753993610"}],"name":"Tank Battle R